  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Developing aquaculture for the Ethiopian market and export</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With a loan supplied by DGGF, Africa Sustainable Aquaculture will be able to extend the already exciting sustainable aquaculture (fish farm) in Ethiopia. The production facility has been built and hardware, such as cages and breeding materials, is available for fish production.The first batch of farmed fish will be ready for production mid 2018. Breeding tilapia intended for the local market and export to surrounding countries and Europe is the company&#x2019;s main focus. The export is expected end of 2018. Both supplying to the local market and exporting the fish will contribute to food security and increase employment.</narrative>
  </description>
